{"id": 261, "date": "2026-10-01T15:41:56", "date_gmt": "2026-10-01T15:41:56", "guid": {"rendered": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/hair-transplantation/", "raw": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/hair-transplantation/"}, "modified": "2026-10-18T08:05:21", "modified_gmt": "2026-10-18T08:05:21", "password": "", "slug": "hair-transplantation", "status": "publish", "type": "page", "link": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/hair-transplantation/", "title": {"raw": "Hair Transplantation", "rendered": "Hair Transplantation"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1392,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling man with full, natural hair in a bright clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1392\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair transplantation treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1310,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Digital scalp analysis in a hair clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1310\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Scalp Analysis</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before any treatment, an AI-supported digital analysis evaluates hair density and thickness, the health of individual follicles and whether they are in a growth or resting phase. This helps to choose the most suitable technique and to track your progress objectively over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1311,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt.jpg\" alt=\"FUE hair transplant procedure in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1311\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Individual follicles are taken one by one from the donor area with a fine, circular micro-punch and implanted into the thinning areas. No linear scar, and a comfortable recovery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1410,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of a full, well-groomed beard and moustache\" class=\"wp-image-1410\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beard and Moustache Transplant</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a fuller, more defined beard or moustache. Follicles, usually from the back of the head, are transplanted into sparse areas. An effective option for uneven growth, scarring or hair loss caused by genetics, hormones or injury.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1411,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of full, natural eyebrows during an eyebrow transplant\" class=\"wp-image-1411\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eyebrow Transplant</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reshapes and strengthens thin, sparse or over-plucked eyebrows with your own hair follicles. A permanent, natural-looking alternative to make-up or microblading.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":973,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a.jpg\" alt=\"Hair transplant procedure in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-973\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sapphire FUE</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An advanced form of FUE in which the channels are opened with blades made of sapphire crystal instead of steel. The finer, sharper blades allow very precise incisions, with less tissue trauma and swelling.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1312,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt.jpg\" alt=\"DHI hair implantation at the hairline\" class=\"wp-image-1312\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DHI (Direct Hair Implantation)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follicles are implanted directly with a special implanter pen (Choi pen), without opening channels in advance. This allows precise control of angle, direction and depth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1313,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Hair transplant procedure in a sterile setting\" class=\"wp-image-1313\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A strip of skin is taken from the donor area and divided into individual follicular units. FUT allows many grafts in one session but leaves a longer linear scar, so it is used today only in selected cases.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Restorative Hair Therapies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not every case of thinning hair needs surgery. Restorative hair therapies nourish and stimulate the hair follicles, help to slow hair loss and improve hair density and quality. They can be used on their own or to support the results of a hair transplant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":764,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy.jpg\" alt=\"Scalp treatment for hair revitalisation in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-764\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exosome Therapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exosomes are tiny vesicles released by cells that carry proteins, lipids and growth signals. For hair restoration they are usually derived from mesenchymal stem cells and injected into thinning areas of the scalp, where they stimulate the follicles, extend the growth phase and support a healthier scalp. Exosomes are often combined with PRP.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1314,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Scalp mesotherapy treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1314\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair Mesotherapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A tailored blend of vitamins, amino acids, plant extracts and other active ingredients is injected into the scalp to nourish the hair follicles. Usually performed as a series of sessions; many patients notice thicker, stronger hair over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A motorised mesotherapy device delivers even micro-injections at a controlled depth, which makes the treatment quicker and more comfortable than manual injections.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":979,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d.jpg\" alt=\"Red light device used during a skin treatment\" class=\"wp-image-979\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Red Light Therapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A non-invasive, low-level light treatment at wavelengths of around 600 to 650 nanometres. The light is absorbed by the follicle cells, stimulates their energy production, improves local circulation and supports healthy hair growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1315,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Blood plasma tubes prepared for PRP treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1315\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A small amount of your own blood is processed in a centrifuge to obtain plasma rich in platelets. Injected into the scalp, it stimulates the hair follicles and supports cell renewal. PRP is a well-established option to reduce hair loss and improve hair density.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We advise you and refer you to the right specialist in T\u00fcrkiye for an online consultation. Medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your hair treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling man with full, natural hair in a bright clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1392\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/hair-transplantation-patient-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair transplantation treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Digital scalp analysis in a hair clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1310\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-kopfhautanalyse-in-der-haarsprechstunde-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Scalp Analysis</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before any treatment, an AI-supported digital analysis evaluates hair density and thickness, the health of individual follicles and whether they are in a growth or resting phase. This helps to choose the most suitable technique and to track your progress objectively over time.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt.jpg\" alt=\"FUE hair transplant procedure in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1311\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/moderne-haartransplantation-in-der-klinik-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Individual follicles are taken one by one from the donor area with a fine, circular micro-punch and implanted into the thinning areas. No linear scar, and a comfortable recovery.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of a full, well-groomed beard and moustache\" class=\"wp-image-1410\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/portrat-eines-gepflegten-vollbarts-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beard and Moustache Transplant</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For a fuller, more defined beard or moustache. Follicles, usually from the back of the head, are transplanted into sparse areas. An effective option for uneven growth, scarring or hair loss caused by genetics, hormones or injury.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"893\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of full, natural eyebrows during an eyebrow transplant\" class=\"wp-image-1411\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt-300x167.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt-1024x572.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt-768x429.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt-1536x857.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-g6hugng6hugng6hu-opt-18x10.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eyebrow Transplant</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reshapes and strengthens thin, sparse or over-plucked eyebrows with your own hair follicles. A permanent, natural-looking alternative to make-up or microblading.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"670\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a.jpg\" alt=\"Hair transplant procedure in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-973\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a.jpg 1280w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a-300x157.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a-1024x536.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a-768x402.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a-18x9.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sapphire FUE</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An advanced form of FUE in which the channels are opened with blades made of sapphire crystal instead of steel. The finer, sharper blades allow very precise incisions, with less tissue trauma and swelling.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt.jpg\" alt=\"DHI hair implantation at the hairline\" class=\"wp-image-1312\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/dhi-haartransplantation-an-der-haarlinie-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DHI (Direct Hair Implantation)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Follicles are implanted directly with a special implanter pen (Choi pen), without opening channels in advance. This allows precise control of angle, direction and depth.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Hair transplant procedure in a sterile setting\" class=\"wp-image-1313\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/prazise-haartransplantation-im-sterilen-op-licht-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A strip of skin is taken from the donor area and divided into individual follicular units. FUT allows many grafts in one session but leaves a longer linear scar, so it is used today only in selected cases.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Restorative Hair Therapies</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Not every case of thinning hair needs surgery. Restorative hair therapies nourish and stimulate the hair follicles, help to slow hair loss and improve hair density and quality. They can be used on their own or to support the results of a hair transplant.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1033\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy.jpg\" alt=\"Scalp treatment for hair revitalisation in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-764\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy-300x194.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy-1024x661.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy-768x496.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy-1536x992.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exosome Therapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exosomes are tiny vesicles released by cells that carry proteins, lipids and growth signals. For hair restoration they are usually derived from mesenchymal stem cells and injected into thinning areas of the scalp, where they stimulate the follicles, extend the growth phase and support a healthier scalp. Exosomes are often combined with PRP.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Scalp mesotherapy treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1314\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/haarskalptherapie-in-moderner-klinik-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair Mesotherapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A tailored blend of vitamins, amino acids, plant extracts and other active ingredients is injected into the scalp to nourish the hair follicles. Usually performed as a series of sessions; many patients notice thicker, stronger hair over time.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A motorised mesotherapy device delivers even micro-injections at a controlled depth, which makes the treatment quicker and more comfortable than manual injections.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d.jpg\" alt=\"Red light device used during a skin treatment\" class=\"wp-image-979\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d.jpg 1280w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Red Light Therapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A non-invasive, low-level light treatment at wavelengths of around 600 to 650 nanometres. The light is absorbed by the follicle cells, stimulates their energy production, improves local circulation and supports healthy hair growth.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Blood plasma tubes prepared for PRP treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1315\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A small amount of your own blood is processed in a centrifuge to obtain plasma rich in platelets. Injected into the scalp, it stimulates the hair follicles and supports cell renewal. PRP is a well-established option to reduce hair loss and improve hair density.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We advise you and refer you to the right specialist in T\u00fcrkiye for an online consultation. Medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your hair treatment with confidence</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}, "excerpt": {"raw": "", "rendered": "<p>Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair. [&hellip;]</p>\n", "protected": false}, "author": 2, "featured_media": 0, "parent": 258, "menu_order": 2, "comment_status": "closed", "ping_status": "closed", "template": "page-with-title", "meta": {"footnotes": ""}, "permalink_template": "https://medluxlife.de/health/clinical-treatments/%pagename%/", "generated_slug": "hair-transplantation", "class_list": ["post-261", "page", "type-page", "status-publish", "hentry"], "_links": {"self": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/261", "targetHints": {"allow": ["GET", "POST", "PUT", "PATCH", "DELETE"]}}], "collection": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages"}], "about": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/types/page"}], "author": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/users/2"}], "replies": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/comments?post=261"}], "version-history": [{"count": 23, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/261/revisions"}], "predecessor-version": [{"id": 2282, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/261/revisions/2282"}], "up": [{"embeddable": true, "href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/258"}], "wp:attachment": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/media?parent=261"}], "wp:action-publish": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/261"}], "wp:action-unfiltered-html": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/261"}], "wp:action-assign-author": [{"href": "https://medluxlife.de/wp-json/wp/v2/pages/261"}], "curies": [{"name": "wp", "href": "https://api.w.org/{rel}", "templated": true}]}}